ption":"A speakeasy-style bar hidden behind an unmarked door. The cocktail menu changes seasonally and the interior feels like stepping into a 1920s bank vault.","address":"82 Eoulmadang-ro, Mapo-gu","tip":"Ring the doorbell and wait — the entrance is intentionally hard to find. Look for the brass plate.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["nightlife-itaewon","best-street-food-myeongdong"],"tags":["Bars","Cocktails","Nightlife"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Venues"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3","children":[["$","$L9",null,{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/venues/cafe-abyss","className":"group flex gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-card transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-secondary/50","style":{"boxShadow":"var(--shadow-card)"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0","children":["$","$L12",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572116469696-31de0f17cc34?w=1200&q=80","alt":"Café Abyss","width":96,"height":96,"className":"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 min-w-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground truncate","children":"Café Abyss"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-primary font-medium mt-0.5 capitalize","children":"bar"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"A moody, candlelit cocktail bar with an extensive whisky list and jazz playing low in the background."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"₩₩₩"}],["$","span",null,{